items.source:
Annotation that can be used on an <a href="Endpoint.html" title="annotation interface in org.springframework.boot.actuate.endpoint.annotation"><code>@Endpoint</code></a> to implement implicit
filtering. Often used as a meta-annotation on technology specific endpoint annotations,
for example:<pre class="code">@Endpoint
@FilteredEndpoint(WebEndpointFilter.class)
public @interface WebEndpoint {

    @AliasFor(annotation = Endpoint.class, attribute = "id")
    String id();

    @AliasFor(annotation = Endpoint.class, attribute = "enableByDefault")
    boolean enableByDefault() default true;

} </pre>

